checkpoint_2026_08_28_slm2_runtime_clean_cut:
  source: commit=8433e691fd7d702992b5e91575466846e30cc05e; tree=acace5041db4aea856f9b5302bfce70037c1a73d
  remote_equality: local HEAD, origin tracking ref, fresh FETCH_HEAD, and direct remote branch all equal the source commit.
  verification: Node standard=1675 pass/0 fail/3 intentional skips/1678 total including real Chromium; Rust fmt, locked offline metadata/build/test, warnings-denied Clippy, and warnings-denied docs pass; managed Release=212 pass/0 fail.
  result: Canonical six-member SLM2 Rust/worker ownership is current; 94,729 obsolete runtime, packer, harness, qualification, and duplicate WASM lines were deleted without a compatibility path.
  next_gate: Replace and delete the obsolete browser CompanionBridge and remaining one-file catalog/acquisition semantics; then rerun enterprise gates before release or deployment.
